---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import headshot from '../assets/headshot.webp';
---

<Base>
  <section class="intro">
    <Image
      src={headshot}
      alt={`Portrait of ${site.name}`}
      width={240}
      densities={[1, 2]}
      loading="eager"
      class="portrait"
    />
    <div>
      <h1>{site.name}</h1>
      <p class="role">{site.role}<br /><span class="muted">{site.org}</span></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="lede">Hellenic by birth. Texan by choice. Architect by discipline.</p>

  <p>Three things I’ve learned in two decades of leading technology in higher education:</p>
  <ul class="lessons">
    <li>The campus closest to the problem usually has the best answer. Listen first.</li>
    <li>AI will not replace judgment. It will expose whether you had any.</li>
    <li>The point of architecture is not to be admired. It is to be load-bearing.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Before The Texas A&amp;M University System, I spent seven years as CTO and Deputy CIO at UT San
    Antonio, where the work that mattered most was the work nobody noticed. I am also a Ph.D.
    candidate in Cybersecurity and AI at UTSA.
  </p>

  <h2>Why limur</h2>
  <p>
    <em>Limur</em> is short for <strong>less is more</strong>: fewer systems, clearer boundaries,
    decisions you can explain.
  </p>

  <figure class="epigraph">
    <blockquote lang="en">Ask that your way be long.</blockquote>
    <figcaption>
      C. P. Cavafy,{' '}
      <cite><a href="https://www.onassis.org/initiatives/cavafy-archive/the-canon/ithaka">Ithaka</a></cite>{' '}
      (1911)
    </figcaption>
  </figure>

  <p class="more"><a href="/research/">Research</a> · <a href="/experience/">Experience</a> · <a href="/speaking/">Speaking</a></p>
</Base>

<style>
  .intro {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .portrait {
    width: 7.5rem;
    height: 7.5rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 50% 25%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .intro h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .role {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .lessons {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .lessons li {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .epigraph {
    margin: 3rem 0 2rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
  }

  .epigraph blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .epigraph figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .more {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 30rem) {
    .intro {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
